			(property "Description" "Broadcom ASSR-601JV automotive photo-MOSFET relay, 1 Form A, 300 mil SO-16 with 12 populated leads. The output is a back-to-back avalanche MOSFET pair with no supply of its own, so the LED-dark state is open by construction. Pin 3 must be left unconnected: it is internally tied to the LED cathode. Pins 11-14 do not exist."
