	(text "SPI0 at 12 MHz on switched 3V3 only (GP16 MISO, GP17 CS, GP18 SCK,\nGP19 MOSI). D6 bulk is now a selected 47 uF: a 200 mA write spike for\n1 ms inside 100 mV of droop needs 2 uF, so this is an order of\nmargin without an oversized can. Any move of this module to a 5 V\nrail re-opens the MISO clearance gate of AS_BUILT S3.5.\nRS-485 reuses keyless MAX3485, DIP-8, tied DE//RE and 10k pulldown.\n390R bias pair and 120R termination have OPEN-by-default shunts.\nExternal bus drive when off can draw 1 mA per A/B pin at +12 V;\nlinked high bias can backfeed dead 3V3. See communications notes.\nJ3 now carries GP13, switched power and ground only. No TVS added.\nJ4 is the RUN-to-GND reset pair and nothing else."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 845.82 308.48 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "62099c57-416f-5f5f-81fe-6d3ea651c740")
	)
